# A name computed sent to `self` in a module or a base class lowers only
# its own file: reaching every includer's and subclass's methods was tried
# and lowered hundreds of rows no send reaches (DEC-666), so Host#plain and
# Sub#other stay clear.
# A block's parameter hides the method's local of its name (Panel), and a
# shape written under a condition leaves the name it may not replace
# (Socket), and so does one in a loop, a pattern match or a block (PumpA,
# PumpB, PumpC); an unknown value written under a condition over a shape
# leaves a name computed (PumpD): each is a name computed, not the shape.
# A literal written where it may not run is sent besides the shape (TapA);
# a `for`, an `&&=` and a body with a `rescue` may not run either (TapB,
# TapC, TapD); `nil` is no name, so a shape after it is read (TapE).
# A symbol held so is cited where it is written (Cite); `nil` over a name
# holds none (VatA); a shape written where it may not run is one more
# beside the first (VatB); a parameter holds any name (VatC).
# A name a send of a send hands on is a call of the method its receiver
# finds, from any file (Valve#relayed), not of another class's (Bystander),
# nor of a private one `public_send` cannot run (Valve#hidden).
# One the index records no symbol for, an operator or a string, lowers the
# method of its name from any file (Grid), or of an alias of it (Spout).
# A computed name sent to a constant in a Haml or ERB template names it
# (Gauge, Dial); its interpolated symbols, mostly translation keys, and
# its method listings are not read (Meter).
dead app Host#plain=unreferenced~ Sub#other=unreferenced~ Unrelated#lonely=unreferenced~ Panel#other_w=unreferenced~Panel Socket#other_g=unreferenced~Socket Valve#relayed=none Bystander#relayed=convention-only Valve#hidden=convention-only Grid#%=unreferenced~:% Grid#+=unreferenced~:+ Grid#spelled=unreferenced~spelled Grid#unsent=unreferenced~ Gauge#reading=unreferenced~Gauge Dial#reading=unreferenced~Dial Spout#pour=convention-only~tip PumpA#other=unreferenced~PumpA PumpB#other=unreferenced~PumpB PumpC#other=unreferenced~PumpC PumpD#other=unreferenced~PumpD Meter#label_x=unreferenced~ TapA#fallback_t=unreferenced~fallback_t TapB#other=unreferenced~TapB TapC#other=unreferenced~TapC TapD#other=unreferenced~TapD TapE#handle_e=unreferenced~sent TapE#other=unreferenced~ Cite#other_z=unreferenced~:other_z VatA#zz_a=unreferenced~ VatB#handle_b=unreferenced~sent VatC#other_c=unreferenced~VatC
